window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A sumptuous collection of five spicy standalone romances that’ll curl your toes and melt your nights! With performances by Elena Wolfe, Teddy Hamilton, Joe Arden, Vanessa Edwin, Jacob Morgan, Emma Wilder, and Shane East.</p> <p>Indulge in the Extravagant After Dark Collection by #1 New York Times Bestseller Lauren Blakely and experience some of your favorite tropes, including: </p> <p>– an engaged couple exploring their midnight desires</p> <p>– a woman determined to fulfill her sexy bucket list with her best friend</p> <p>– a weekend fling igniting between amorous colleagues</p> <p>– a billionaire falling for her bodyguard after a wild weekend with him and his rock star best friend </p> <p>– and a hotel heiress swept up in a masquerade that sparks a rivalry between two competing hoteliers</p> <p>This collection delivers sinful, luxurious, elegant, and steamy nights you won’t forget....</p> <p>NOTE: These titles have previously been available in separate collections. They are now grouped together for the first time in one complete set!</p>"; 
